{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/28/6148124/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆっきーな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはよう(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ままがさっきから\nお餅のこと豆腐豆腐言ってるよ(´・ω・`)\n何度訂正しても豆腐って言う(´・ω・`)\nそして間違えてることに気づかない(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白くて四角かったら\nなんでも豆腐だと思ってんのかなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、昨日は真面目に勉強してたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宿題やってただけだけど←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてヨシヒコ見ながらやってたから\n全般進んでない(´・∀・`)\n何回も見た回なのにね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは最近できてなかった\n振りコピもしてたよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近実力派なアイドルがすごい好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、\n今日中に宿題終わらせます(゜ロ゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ短くてすみません＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ、みなさんも\n今日も１日がんばってね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}